<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="profile"><view class="avatar">陇</view><view class="grow"><text class="page-title">{{session.user ? (mode === 'mock' ? '家乡好物体验官' : '已登录的微信用户') : '欢迎来家乡逛逛'}}</text><text class="body-copy">{{mode === 'mock' ? '本机模拟资料，不会同步服务器' : '登录后购物资料和订单保存云端'}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!session.user}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">登录后，接着逛</text><text class="body-copy">查看自己的购物车、订单、收藏和售后。无需填写微信昵称、手机号或真实地址。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">{{mode === 'mock' ? '进入模拟账号' : '微信登录'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{mode === 'cloud' && session.user}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">我的云端账户</text><text class="small muted">采购者授权时，将账户编号交给平台管理员。编号不会赋予任何管理权限。</text><text class="account-id" selectable="{{true}}">{{session.user.id}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="copyAccount" disabled="{{processing}}">复制账户编号</button><view wx:if="{{session.canManage}}" class="menu-row" data-page="workbench" bindtap="go"><text>商家工作台</text><text>→</text></view><view wx:if="{{session.role === 'admin'}}" class="menu-row" data-page="merchants" bindtap="go"><text>微信采购者管理</text><text>→</text></view></view><view class="surface"><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">我的订单</text><button class="text-button" data-page="orders" bindtap="go">全部订单 →</button></view><view class="quick-links"><button data-page="orders" data-filter="waiting" bindtap="go">待发货</button><button data-page="orders" data-filter="shipped" bindtap="go">待收货</button><button data-page="orders" data-filter="after" bindtap="go">订单售后</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{session.user}}" class="surface"><view class="info-row"><text>示例收货地区</text><picker range="{{addresses}}" range-key="label" value="{{addressIndex}}" bindchange="address"><text class="text-link">{{addressLabel}}　⌄</text></picker></view><text class="small muted">仅模拟配送地区，不收真实个人地址。</text></view><view class="surface"><view class="menu-row" data-page="guide" bindtap="go"><text>完整体验指南</text><text>→</text></view><view class="menu-row" data-page="shops" bindtap="go"><text>认识采购者店铺</text><text>→</text></view><view class="menu-row" bindtap="refresh"><text>重新读取资料</text><text>↻</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{session.user}}"><view class="filters"><button class="filter {{collection === 'favorites' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="favorites" bindtap="collection">收藏 {{favoritesCount}}</button><button class="filter {{collection === 'recent' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="recent" bindtap="collection">浏览足迹 {{recentCount}}</button></view><view class="product-grid"><view wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" class="product-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openProduct"><image binderror="imageFailed" class="product-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="product-copy"><text class="product-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.origin}}</text><view class="price-line"><text class="price">¥{{item.priceText}}</text><text class="muted small">起 · 模拟</text></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!products.length}}" class="empty">这里还没有好物，去首页发现喜欢的吧。</view><button wx:if="{{mode === 'cloud'}}" class="text-button" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{processing}}">{{mode === 'mock' ? '退出模拟账号' : '退出登录'}}</button></view><view class="note">当前为特产商城模拟体验，无支付、真实物流或退款。普通买家不会因为登录获得商家管理权限。</view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
